                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[u]Premise[/u]\n\nA fun and satisfying number puzzle game that is easy to understand but becomes increasingly challenging. The concept is simple: use the given measurements and areas to figure out the missing value, but the restriction to whole numbers makes some puzzles require a surprising amount of thought. \n\n[u]Puzzles and Difficulty[/u]\n\nThere are 3 sections. Each section has 20 puzzles. Total completion time can be as little as 8 minutes. The puzzles revolve around finding missing values within connected rectangles using basic area math. Early puzzles are fairly simple and help teach how everything works, while later puzzles require more experimentation and creative thinking to determine the correct values. No advanced mathematics is necessary.\n",
